Include the absolute subpixel origin when rasterizing text. Keep the integer
translation outside the glyph geometry and invalidate it when its fractional
origin changes. Geometry::Render rounds its translation, so rasterizing before
accounting for that fraction selects the wrong glyph coverage and position.

